WEBVTT

00:00.870 --> 00:01.670
Tsuwabuki-kun.

00:02.940 --> 00:03.640
Yes?

00:05.180 --> 00:06.860
I'll ask just in case, but...

00:07.580 --> 00:08.910
Right now...

00:09.820 --> 00:10.860
What month is it?

00:11.200 --> 00:12.970
Umm, what month you say?

00:17.200 --> 00:20.290
It's May.

00:24.690 --> 00:28.540
Right now, it's November... Tsuwabuki-kun.

00:32.160 --> 00:36.690
Just as I expected, your memory is in a mess.

00:37.590 --> 00:45.020
This must be the effect of being exposed to magic from Figurare too many times.

00:45.720 --> 00:48.550
Is something going to happen to me?

00:49.020 --> 00:51.830
When all seven star drops are gathered,

00:52.540 --> 00:57.300
I will then use them to concoct a medicine to return you to normal as Tsuwabuki Masaharu.

00:58.320 --> 00:59.210
But at the same time,

01:00.230 --> 01:07.020
you will forget everything that happened this past half year, Tsuwabuki-kun.

01:08.410 --> 01:13.550
You will forget all that time that you shared with Sumomo-chan.

01:13.550 --> 01:14.400
Everything.

01:34.150 --> 01:40.870
Shining stars away bless

01:34.690 --> 01:40.870
Shining stars away bless

01:41.200 --> 01:46.080
chiisakutonaeru mahou no kotobawa

01:41.200 --> 01:46.080
Silently chanting the magical words

01:46.960 --> 01:48.710
『onegai。。。』

01:46.960 --> 01:48.710
"please"

01:49.000 --> 01:54.340
hoshizora samayou kaze ni notta maigo notsubu

01:49.000 --> 01:54.340
The lost grain riding the wind on the sky

01:54.340 --> 01:55.380
『kizuite。。。』

01:54.340 --> 01:55.380
Please notice

01:55.380 --> 02:03.260
tsutawara nakute porori ochita kono omoi

01:55.380 --> 02:03.260
Untold words, teardrops of feelings that fell down

02:03.760 --> 02:10.350
kagayaki dasuyo GARASU bin nonaka

02:03.760 --> 02:10.350
Show your shine inside the glass bottle

02:10.730 --> 02:17.740
manten no hoshi deatta KISEKI kimi ga soba ni itekureru nara

02:10.730 --> 02:17.740
If you will stay beside me perfect star of encountered miracles...

02:17.900 --> 02:25.120
Whatever the mystery, I will be able to gather my courage.

02:18.320 --> 02:25.120
donna fushigi mouke tomeru yuuki umare te yuku yo

02:25.450 --> 02:32.710
nanatsuiro ni hikaru houseki sora kara mai oriru

02:25.450 --> 02:32.710
Seven colored glittering gems flying down from the sky

02:32.710 --> 02:36.420
Scoop up the important fragments

02:33.130 --> 02:36.420
daijina KAKERA sukui agerune

02:36.420 --> 02:41.930
kowasa nuyou sotto。。。

02:36.420 --> 02:41.930
And secretly hold onto them tight

02:51.490 --> 02:55.030
Umm... Err....

02:55.690 --> 02:56.890
Yuki-chan.

02:59.180 --> 03:04.460
Err, the Yuki-chan that I slept together with,

03:04.460 --> 03:07.880
bathed together, and also kissed...

03:08.230 --> 03:09.620
Umm...

03:11.040 --> 03:12.320
is actually Haru-kun?

03:13.990 --> 03:14.590
Yes.

03:18.400 --> 03:20.740
That's so...!

03:24.670 --> 03:28.540
What are you doing, Sumomo?

03:29.390 --> 03:32.360
This is so embarrassing!

03:35.170 --> 03:39.650
Haru-kun saw me too...

03:39.650 --> 03:42.720
No I didn't! Well I did, but...

03:42.720 --> 03:45.570
How can I say this... During that time, it was kind of different.

03:45.570 --> 03:47.310
I was Yuki-chan, so...

03:48.160 --> 03:50.120
Umm... so that is...

03:51.720 --> 03:53.000
So you did see...

03:59.950 --> 04:05.260
<i>Right, I haven't told Sumomo anything about what Kisaragi-sensei told me.</i>

04:06.530 --> 04:10.760
If you stay as you are and don't do anything,

04:11.420 --> 04:13.870
the time will come when you will permanently stay as a doll.

04:14.950 --> 04:16.300
You don't have any other choice here.

04:17.500 --> 04:18.300
Sumomo...

04:24.050 --> 04:27.700
<i>A few months passed without me telling her about it.</i>

04:29.430 --> 04:32.870
So, Sensei, with these past six months...

04:32.870 --> 04:36.410
...you're saying that Tsuwabuki... will forget all of it?

04:37.040 --> 04:39.050
Even about him seeing Sumomo?

04:44.970 --> 04:47.070
That's... cruel.

04:47.920 --> 04:49.070
Sumomo...

04:49.500 --> 04:50.980
It was my fault!

04:51.550 --> 04:54.070
Everything was... my fault.

04:54.380 --> 04:57.420
Yuuki, it's not like that.

04:59.590 --> 05:00.510
Yaeno-san...

05:01.260 --> 05:07.750
Sumomo and Tsuwabuki definitely don't hate or blame anyone.

05:10.270 --> 05:14.070
That is why those two managed to make it this far.

05:15.840 --> 05:22.040
Saying that the reason why Sumomo-chan, who never used a Ladle before was able to excel at using it...

05:23.430 --> 05:26.050
...was because of a sheep doll, did sound unusual.

05:27.680 --> 05:30.200
It was certainly strange even to me.

05:31.470 --> 05:34.350
But now, I am sure of it.

05:35.270 --> 05:37.610
They are both each other's strength.

05:39.780 --> 05:45.030
The kindness that is shared between them became a miracle.

05:46.570 --> 05:47.070
Yes.

05:51.760 --> 05:54.210
It's somewhat strange, but yet, it happened like that.

05:54.210 --> 05:55.370
And then...

05:58.920 --> 05:59.510
Sumomo?

06:00.270 --> 06:04.630
Haru-kun, the star drop will fall down tonight.

06:06.310 --> 06:09.400
The seventh star drop will come!

06:12.630 --> 06:13.430
Finally...

06:16.800 --> 06:17.600
Sumomo...

06:19.020 --> 06:20.130
I'm home!

06:21.310 --> 06:22.340
Welcome!

06:22.890 --> 06:24.040
Just kidding.

06:24.040 --> 06:27.300
Well, I'm happy...

06:27.790 --> 06:30.100
because Haru-kun is in my room.

06:30.100 --> 06:30.930
Sumomo...

06:30.930 --> 06:35.120
Umm, tonight, Dad will be at an event so no one else will be home.

06:35.430 --> 06:38.070
He said it might be pretty scary, so it'd be better just to stay at home...

06:38.070 --> 06:42.010
Ahh! By staying, he didn't mean like staying for the night or anything...

06:42.010 --> 06:44.160
W-What am I saying...!?

06:44.940 --> 06:45.710
Sumomo...!

06:47.800 --> 06:51.800
Umm, so we'll finally be able to gather all seven star drops.

07:24.600 --> 07:29.560
The seventh star drop will come from that side.

07:33.310 --> 07:36.940
The day we've been waiting for has finally come, hasn't it?

07:38.470 --> 07:40.550
We've gathered them one by one.

07:46.910 --> 07:48.230
Puruvu Radi!

07:50.570 --> 07:52.880
Always together with Yuki-chan...

07:55.950 --> 07:58.560
Always being encouraged by Yuki-chan...

08:06.750 --> 08:09.670
And being given courage by Yuki-chan.

08:19.670 --> 08:21.650
Thank you, Yuki-chan.

08:23.630 --> 08:29.100
There were some hard times too during this past half year, but it was fun.

08:30.120 --> 08:34.480
It's too bad we can't be together tonight to capture the seventh star drop since it's a new moon.

08:35.350 --> 08:39.600
It's kind of lonely because we can't meet, but...

08:40.160 --> 08:44.220
This time, I can be together with Haru-kun for the whole evening.

08:45.380 --> 08:50.660
I hope that like I did with Yuki-chan, Haru-kun will have fun too.

08:50.660 --> 08:51.270
Sumomo...

08:51.270 --> 08:56.670
Well, it won't be as mysterious as before, but...

08:56.670 --> 09:01.320
Sumomo, I have to tell you something!

09:04.310 --> 09:05.420
Haru-kun?

09:08.720 --> 09:11.530
There is something that I haven't told you, Sumomo.

09:12.360 --> 09:16.440
When we gather the star drops... all seven of them...

09:18.320 --> 09:19.150
After that...

09:20.600 --> 09:21.220
After that happens...

09:22.730 --> 09:25.160
I'm sorry... I'll...

09:31.720 --> 09:33.490
So something will happen...

09:35.820 --> 09:37.940
Something sad...

09:42.970 --> 09:45.070
I had this premonition...

09:46.270 --> 09:52.690
Because everything has been going all too well with Haru-kun.

09:55.470 --> 10:01.150
That perhaps it's all just a dream... and that everything will disappear when I open my eyes.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.530
I felt afraid...

10:09.970 --> 10:13.110
That when we would capture the final star drop...

10:15.720 --> 10:19.120
Haru-kun would disappear.

10:20.110 --> 10:20.770
It felt like...

10:26.380 --> 10:27.230
Sumomo...

10:35.530 --> 10:37.560
When all seven star drops are gathered...

10:39.070 --> 10:41.620
After drinking the medicine and returning to normal...

10:43.530 --> 10:44.780
I...

10:49.900 --> 10:51.100
will forget everything!

10:52.700 --> 10:53.170
Everything!

10:55.040 --> 10:56.380
From the moment I turned into Yuki-chan...

10:56.380 --> 10:57.440
...and everything after that.

10:58.790 --> 11:01.050
The time we spent together...

11:02.140 --> 11:02.700
My feelings...

11:03.980 --> 11:10.150
I will forget... just about everything.

11:20.880 --> 11:24.750
The first time going home together...

11:26.450 --> 11:32.110
We planted a lot of hydrangeas, didn't we?

11:33.550 --> 11:37.590
I got to talk to Haru-kun when we were alone together.

11:40.320 --> 11:43.950
My heart felt like it skipped a beat.

11:45.620 --> 11:49.400
It was always beating so fast.

11:52.650 --> 11:55.810
You're going to forget... everything?

12:05.740 --> 12:09.350
I... I don't want you to.

12:11.310 --> 12:13.850
I don't want you... to forget.

12:19.630 --> 12:20.740
No, I don't want this.

12:21.020 --> 12:23.330
Haru-kun, Haru-kun!

12:40.990 --> 12:41.770
Sumomo...

12:51.630 --> 12:52.780
I don't want to forget either!

12:56.510 --> 12:57.500
I don't want to forget...

12:58.580 --> 12:59.540
about you, Sumomo.

13:02.830 --> 13:03.960
Haru-kun...

13:15.560 --> 13:16.440
This is...

13:20.280 --> 13:23.130
It seems like it's encouraging us...

13:24.080 --> 13:25.540
saying "Don't cry"...

13:26.530 --> 13:29.930
and that the seventh star drop is waiting.

13:33.010 --> 13:34.290
That's right!

13:36.430 --> 13:40.280
Haru-kun needs to return to normal.

13:42.140 --> 13:43.040
Sumomo...

14:04.360 --> 14:06.480
<i>Before I forget just about everything,</i>

14:08.110 --> 14:12.020
<i>I want to imprint Sumomo's figure in my heart.</i>

14:23.650 --> 14:25.040
<i>Being as lovely as she is,</i>

14:26.600 --> 14:30.840
<i>will I really forget these feelings?</i>

14:43.530 --> 14:44.310
<i>Sumomo...</i>

14:47.180 --> 14:48.060
<i>Haru-kun...</i>

14:54.750 --> 14:57.240
<i>If only this moment would last longer, even by just a second. </i>

15:01.310 --> 15:03.690
<i>If only our time lasted longer by even just a second. </i>

15:04.730 --> 15:07.140
<i>It would be good if time could just stop.</i>

15:32.300 --> 15:36.520
It's too bad... We don't really remember which boat we used that day.

15:38.930 --> 15:43.740
That time, I was really shy and embarrassed, so I was at a loss of what to say.

15:44.890 --> 15:45.670
Me too!

16:04.350 --> 16:06.940
They were in full bloom at that time...

16:15.860 --> 16:18.170
That's right, Sumomo. Remember the bell?

16:19.250 --> 16:22.080
The Bell of Hope, right? Let's go take a look.

16:23.480 --> 16:23.950
Okay!

16:26.280 --> 16:29.830
When the bell rings while a couple is together...

16:29.830 --> 16:30.600
Umm...

16:31.990 --> 16:34.420
the couple's future will be connected.

16:38.140 --> 16:40.480
<i>The bell which we didn't ring that day...</i>

16:44.820 --> 16:49.940
<i>After that we just sat down together without saying anything...</i>

16:52.220 --> 16:53.900
<i>...until the last moment.</i>

17:19.320 --> 17:20.290
The ring is...

17:24.490 --> 17:26.960
Haru-kun, let me see your cell phone.

17:30.050 --> 17:35.100
I'll delete all the messages that I've sent to you and also my e-mail address, okay?

17:35.990 --> 17:39.340
That way, you don't feel strange looking at it later.

17:39.740 --> 17:41.490
Eh, Sumomo?

17:45.170 --> 17:49.860
It was only for two months, but there is a lot here already.

18:17.150 --> 18:18.350
The star drop!

18:22.740 --> 18:24.060
The other star drops too...

18:26.530 --> 18:27.080
Sumomo.

18:31.750 --> 18:33.750
Sumomo, listen.

18:36.150 --> 18:37.550
Y-Yes?

18:39.030 --> 18:45.330
Even if I forget everything, I... I will...

18:48.820 --> 18:52.140
I will love Sumomo once again. I know it!

18:58.630 --> 18:58.980
Yes!

18:59.970 --> 19:00.610
It's a promise.

19:02.030 --> 19:04.900
Yes. I'll be waiting, then.

19:05.870 --> 19:08.110
I'll wait without crying.

19:59.030 --> 20:01.410
Good morning!

20:01.740 --> 20:02.680
Are you serious?!

20:02.680 --> 20:04.090
I see...

20:05.820 --> 20:07.190
What does that mean?!

20:07.590 --> 20:10.460
Is it true that Tsuwabuki-kun lost his memory?

20:11.570 --> 20:12.390
Yes.

20:13.190 --> 20:17.520
I don't know the details, but according to Kisaragi-sensei,

20:18.390 --> 20:24.920
Tsuwabuki lost all of his memory of this past half year.

20:26.220 --> 20:27.360
This past half year?

20:27.360 --> 20:31.740
T-Then, what about his going out with Sumomo?

20:34.330 --> 20:37.230
T-Then he really forgot everything?

20:37.230 --> 20:39.290
This can't be! Seriously?!

20:39.290 --> 20:41.210
No way...

20:42.040 --> 20:45.340
Let's tell him everything about this past half year!

20:45.340 --> 20:47.540
That's right, let's do it together!

20:47.540 --> 20:48.220
No, you shouldn't.

20:49.900 --> 20:51.240
No, you shouldn't do it now.

20:52.540 --> 20:55.440
It's better if we don't tell Tsuwabuki anything.

20:56.070 --> 21:00.370
If we confuse him now, there's a chance it'll get worse.

21:04.780 --> 21:05.480
Haru...

21:06.430 --> 21:09.140
I feel bad for Sumomo-chan.

21:15.040 --> 21:17.110
<i>I won't cry...</i>

21:19.000 --> 21:24.040
<i>because... because Haru-kun made a promise to me.</i>

21:30.950 --> 21:31.760
<i>Haru-kun...</i>

21:38.290 --> 21:40.320
A-Are you all right?

21:43.740 --> 21:44.920
I'm sorry.

21:48.150 --> 21:49.870
Tsuwabuki-kun...

21:52.770 --> 21:55.350
Umm... Well, I'm...

21:55.350 --> 21:56.310
That is...

21:56.830 --> 21:59.160
I'm sorry too, Tsuwabuki-kun.

22:00.620 --> 22:02.670
How do you know my name?

22:04.510 --> 22:06.280
We're in the same class.

22:06.280 --> 22:07.840
I-I see.

22:09.250 --> 22:09.820
Well then...

22:16.610 --> 22:17.740
Haru-kun...

22:20.570 --> 22:23.500
I believe in you, so...

22:25.310 --> 22:29.700
It's a promise, so I'll wait and I won't cry...

22:32.600 --> 22:33.400
...Haru-kun.

22:51.680 --> 22:55.220
kira kira no hoshikuzu ha maru de

22:51.680 --> 22:55.220
Fragments of glittering stars

22:55.220 --> 22:58.520
koi suru otome no kiseki

22:55.220 --> 22:58.520
are just like the miracles of a girl in love

22:58.770 --> 23:02.310
kinou mada no watashi ha doko he

22:58.770 --> 23:02.310
Where did the cleverness from yesterday go,

23:02.310 --> 23:05.230
nanika chigau RABIRINSU

23:02.310 --> 23:05.230
Since it's like a labyrinth now

23:05.730 --> 23:09.490
dan dan wakan naku naru

23:05.730 --> 23:09.490
Slowly becoming confused

23:09.650 --> 23:12.490
（doushi you　doushi you）

23:09.650 --> 23:12.490
What do I do? What do I do?

23:12.740 --> 23:19.710
don don afurete kuru　AH　HAHAHA

23:12.740 --> 23:19.710
Slowly becoming overflowed

23:19.870 --> 23:25.590
yume no naka jya　nandemo ieru no ni…

23:19.870 --> 23:25.590
But inside a dream, can't you say anything?

23:25.590 --> 23:29.220
yuuki kudasai

23:25.590 --> 23:29.220
Please give me courage

23:30.510 --> 23:32.140
mo-o！

23:30.510 --> 23:32.140
Mo-o!

23:32.300 --> 23:36.970
konna ni aitai no ni

23:32.300 --> 23:36.970
I really want to meet you

23:36.970 --> 23:39.270
kanari Bi-myo

23:36.970 --> 23:39.270
Proxy doll

23:39.430 --> 23:43.190
toki meki ga koi no saidai no teki

23:39.430 --> 23:43.190
This throbbing is love's biggest challenge

23:43.190 --> 23:44.770
jirettai no yo

23:43.190 --> 23:44.770
It's irritating

23:44.770 --> 23:46.110
ne-e

23:44.770 --> 23:46.110
Isn't it?

23:46.520 --> 23:51.240
yume kara sametara mata

23:46.520 --> 23:51.240
The reasons to wake again

23:51.240 --> 23:56.780
kobore souna kimi no egao ni

23:51.240 --> 23:56.780
Are overflowing to see your smile

23:56.780 --> 23:59.700
airu kana

23:56.780 --> 23:59.700
If we meet again

24:10.280 --> 24:12.550
Aww, the last episode is already here.

24:10.880 --> 24:12.550
Next Episode

24:12.550 --> 24:13.750
That can't be!

24:13.750 --> 24:15.970
It'll be so sad for Sumomo if things keep on going like this!

24:15.970 --> 24:18.750
Please God let them be happy together!

24:18.750 --> 24:19.500
That's right, Haru!

24:19.500 --> 24:21.790
I'll not forgive you if you make a cute girl like her cry!

24:21.520 --> 24:25.060
Episode 12

24:21.520 --> 24:25.060
First Love is Seven Colored

24:21.790 --> 24:22.850
Yes, unforgivable!

24:22.850 --> 24:24.690
They will definitely have a happy ending!
